Hello Angus and team,

an offer for an independent review, with the framing your contact page asks
for: this is a manual modelling tool, and the test I am proposing involves no
AI at all.

Solidon3D reads downloaded 3D models and makes their features editable without
CAD knowledge. The test that shows the difference in a few minutes: open any
model with a knurled grip or a honeycomb panel. In a mesh tool that is a few
hundred faces and nothing to edit. In Solidon 0.5.0 it is one feature with
pitch, cell width and depth — removed with a click, reapplied with three
numbers. On a cylinder the pattern is measured in the unrolled surface, so the
grooves are equally deep all the way round and the pattern closes without a
seam.

The structural change of this release is that the part stays exact: primitives
are built with real faces and edges, and holes, slots, countersinks, bosses,
beads, grooves and threads survive moving, duplicating, rotating and removing
without being converted to triangles. STEP goes in and comes back out cleanly,
so the result can be checked in a CAD system rather than judged by eye.

On the AI question, so it is stated plainly rather than discovered later:
there is an assistant in the product. It is optional, it can be switched off,
it can run locally on your own GPU, and no function of the software depends on
it. The review I am asking for is of the modelling tool.

Solidon3D runs on Windows, macOS and Linux, is a one-time purchase with no
subscription, and works fully offline after a single activation — no account,
no telemetry. A review licence is available on request, and the demo is
complete enough for the test above if you would rather not hold a licence.

Solidon3D is a desktop application for Windows, macOS and Linux. One-time
purchase, no subscription, no account: after a single activation it runs fully
offline. Interface and manual are available in six languages, and there is a
demo.

I am happy to provide a review licence, print-resolution images or answers to
any question directly.

